with reviewed(id, patch) as (
  values
    (205::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'This is an all-day café, not a velvet-rope night out. Breakfast and weekday coffee are easy; the broad terrace and lunch tables become the squeeze when Brussels gets sun, and Friday-Saturday drinks run later. Order at the bar when service is busy. The real address is Rue du Marché au Charbon 91.',
      'best_nights', 'Come late morning for specialty coffee and breakfast, or let a bright afternoon stretch into natural wine and cocktails on the terrace. Friday and Saturday work as queer pre-drinks, but the reopened café feels most distinctive when food, daylight and neighbourhood gossip overlap.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Queer locals, artists and design-minded friends share the room with city workers, brunch regulars and Grand-Place visitors. It feels visibly LGBTQ+ without becoming a single-gender bar. The balance leans local by day and more international as the terrace fills toward the weekend.',
      'dress_code', 'There is no dress code: coffee-run layers, office clothes, vintage finds and a full going-out look can land at neighbouring tables. Dress for the terrace and Brussels weather rather than a door test. The vegetarian and vegan menu also makes this an easy mixed-group meeting point before anyone commits to the night.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Recent guests describe the reopened team as kind, quick and genuinely welcoming, especially with mixed groups. The café is queer-led in mood rather than guarded at the threshold. Toilet upkeep appears in older feedback, but hospitality and food quality dominate the current consensus.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_reopened_queer_led_all_day_cafe_restaurant_and_terrace_in_brussels_gay_street_with_specialty_coffee_vegetarian_food_natural_wine_cocktails_and_mixed_local_visitor_crowd',
      'identity_note', 'Le Fontainas reopened under a new creative team in 2025 after a closure. Its current official address is Rue du Marché au Charbon 91, 1000 Brussels; the stored Rue des Ursulines 4 address is incorrect.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.lefontainas.be/','https://lefooding.com/en/restaurants/le-fontainas-2','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/2658631/caf%C3%A9-le-fontainas','https://www.corner.inc/place/pNUEZ8rnhoiN','https://brussels.gaycities.com/restaurants/303291-le-fontainas?type=cafe']::text[]),
      'topic_evidence', jsonb_build_object(
