    (207::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'Big-name Friday and Saturday bills can sell out and stack a serious Marolles queue. Buy early, but a presale still does not guarantee admission; security keeps final say. Door tickets may remain when online sales close, and early arrival gives the best chance. Entry is 18+ and searches are possible.',
      'best_nights', 'Follow the DJ, not the weekday. Long, properly programmed techno nights define the club; harder bookings draw the fiercest room, while queer or Pride editions change the social temperature. The main floor now has a rebuilt system, so arrive before peak crush if sound and space matter equally.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Brussels techno loyalists meet international ravers, artist fans and newer clubbers who know the headline more than the room. It is strongly queer-friendly and hosts queer dates, but an ordinary weekend is music-led rather than an LGBTQ+ party. Sold-out crowds can become pushy despite excellent programming.',
      'dress_code', 'The code favours muted, functional, darker clubwear and closed dance-safe shoes. Suits, high heels, sandals, flip-flops and glowing accessories can be refused; toplessness is welcome for every gender. Phone cameras are stickered and filming inside is forbidden, though official photographers may work.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Recent guests praise friendly staff, clean free toilets, lockers and a well-run room. Trained awareness and hospitality teams, a calm safe zone and a reporting contact cover discrimination or non-consent. That structure matters, while crowding and rough dancers remain the repeated weak point.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_landmark_marolles_techno_club_since_1994_with_international_lineups_rebuilt_main_sound_system_no_phone_dancefloor_functional_dress_policy_awareness_team_and_queer_specific_events',
      'identity_note', 'Fuse is currently at Rue Blaes/Blaesstraat 208, 1000 Brussels. The stored Rue des Tanneurs 127 address is outdated and should be corrected before map directions are trusted.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.fuse.be/','https://www.fuse.be/faq','https://www.fuse.be/news/room-01-new-sound-system','https://www.fuse.be/news/official-statement','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/1357077/fuse','https://ket.brussels/2026/04/30/fuse-is-turning-pride-into-a-full-throttle-queer-night/','https://www.reddit.com/r/Techno/comments/1m9o638']::text[]),
