    (203::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'The current incarnation is a tiny café-bar, not the cruise club described in this listing. Weekdays are usually an easy walk-in; the few seats, summer terrace and Pride or themed evenings can fill fast. Go before the late-evening rush if you want a proper conversation. The real address is Rue du Marché au Charbon 5.',
      'best_nights', 'Early evening is ideal for a Homo Colada, Belgian beer and a chat before moving along the gay street. Weekends bring more colour, while drag, art, fetish socials and watch parties make selected dates the real draw. In warm weather the little terrace changes it from a cosy winter den into a neighbourhood lookout.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Queer regulars, gay men, mixed LGBTQ+ friends and international visitors settle in together, with bartenders often bridging the languages and introductions. It is intimate enough that tourists do not feel anonymous and locals still set the tone. This is a social drinking bar first, not a men-only cruising crowd.',
      'dress_code', 'Dress as you would for a small queer café: casual layers, a date-night look or fetish accents all work. There is no fashion door. Space is the practical constraint, so bulky coats are less useful than personality. Save a glance for the playful art and famously decorated bathroom.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Hospitality is the clearest review pattern: solo visitors, couples and English-speaking tourists call the owners and bartenders warm, funny and attentive. Guests relax quickly and return on consecutive nights. The small scale makes the team part of the atmosphere rather than distant service staff.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_small_queer_cafe_bar_by_spit_it_out_at_new_gay_street_address_with_cocktails_beer_terrace_art_drag_watch_and_fetish_socials_mixed_local_international_crowd_and_exceptional_host_consensus',
      'identity_note', 'The current Homo Erectus by Spit It Out is a café-bar at Rue du Marché au Charbon 5, 1000 Brussels. The stored Rue Henri Maus 2 address and cruise-club classification do not describe the current venue.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.instagram.com/homoerectus.bxl/','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/4177643/lhomoerectus-by-spit-it-out','https://whereis.gay/homoerectus-bar','https://localguide.brussels/en/spot/lhomo-erectus/','https://qlist.app/venues/Bruxelles/The-Homo-Erectus-Bar/NGNzbTUzbXFLYzArK2hERzllNzI0QQ/fr']::text[]),
